# Spotify Web API Credentials (Optional)
# If provided, the app connects live to Spotify API for millions of tracks.
# If omitted or expired, the app seamlessly runs in Offline Dataset Mode.
# Get free credentials at: https://developer.spotify.com/dashboard

SPOTIPY_CLIENT_ID=your_spotify_client_id_here
SPOTIPY_CLIENT_SECRET=your_spotify_client_secret_here
